Sources and tools / Zdroje a nástroje
-------------------------------------

These are not people to thank here but works the disk stands on; their licences are
listed in the "attribution" field of datadisk.yaml: the translation of N. K. Sanders
(Epic text, public domain), the Electronic Babylonian Library (eBL), Copernicus DEM GLO-30,
OpenStreetMap, ETOPO 2022 (NOAA) and the art of 0 A.D. (Wildfire Games, CC BY-SA 3.0).
Part of the models, portraits and voices was made with AI tools (Blender, InvokeAI,
Hyper3D Rodin, Piper) and the code with Claude Code; the maintainer is responsible for
the result, and scholarly errors found by reviewers are corrected, not defended.
